                     Table "public.ordering_sales_hour"
   Column    |            Type             | Collation | Nullable | Default 
-------------+-----------------------------+-----------+----------+---------
 hour_start  | timestamp(0) with time zone |           | not null | 
 shard       | smallint                    |           | not null | 
 order_count | integer                     |           | not null | 
 gross       | bigint                      |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "ordering_sales_hour_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (hour_start, shard)
Check constraints:
    "ordering_sales_hour_hour_check" CHECK (hour_start = date_bin('01:00:00'::interval, hour_start, '2000-01-01 00:00:00+00'::timestamp with time zone))
    "ordering_sales_hour_shard_check" CHECK (shard >= 0 AND shard <= 15)
    "ordering_sales_hour_totals_check" CHECK (order_count >= 0 AND gross >= 0)

                    Table "public.inventory_stock_item"
   Column   |            Type             | Collation | Nullable | Default 
------------+-----------------------------+-----------+----------+---------
 variant_id | uuid                        |           | not null | 
 physical   | integer                     |           | not null | 
 reserved   | integer                     |           | not null | 
 version    | integer                     |           | not null | 
 updated_at | timestamp(0) with time zone |           | not null | 
 product_id | uuid                        |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "inventory_stock_item_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (variant_id)
    "inventory_stock_item_low_stock_idx" btree (product_id) WHERE (physical - reserved) >= 1 AND (physical - reserved) <= 5
    "inventory_stock_item_out_of_stock_idx" btree (product_id) WHERE (physical - reserved) = 0
Check constraints:
    "inventory_stock_item_quantities_check" CHECK (reserved >= 0 AND physical >= reserved AND physical <= 1000000)

